OL,3,AGladiator II stuntman sues over
OL,4,Ainjuries from on-set explosion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British stuntman and actor is suing
OL,7,Fone of the companies behind Gladiator
OL,8,FII, saying he suffered "excruciating"
OL,9,Fburns and permanent scarring in an
OL,10,Faccident while filming a scene on a
OL,11,Fburning ship.
OL,13,FEdward Sarsfield was playing a dead
OL,14,Fsoldier in the movie in 2023 when a gas
OL,15,Fline used for special effects exploded
OL,16,Fon the vessel, causing 20ft flames that
OL,17,Fmade his costume catch fire, his legal
OL,18,Fclaim said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
